---
---

<section
        id="process"
        class="process-section"
        data-header-theme="dark"
        data-process
        aria-labelledby="process-heading"
      >
        <div class="process-pin" data-process-pin>
          <div class="process-stage">
            <header class="process-head">
              <h2 class="what-badge font-display" id="process-heading">
                How do we work?
              </h2>
              <p class="process-lead font-display word-reveal" data-process-lead>
                Three passes. Each one makes the next one simpler.
              </p>
            </header>

            <div class="process-grid" data-process-grid>
              <article class="process-card" data-process-card>
                <div class="process-visual" data-process-visual>
                  <img
                    class="process-visual-inner process-icon-svg"
                    src="/assets/process-brief.svg"
                    alt=""
                    width="284"
                    height="295"
                  />
                </div>
                <span class="process-badge font-display" data-process-badge>01</span>
                <div data-process-copy>
                  <h3 class="process-title font-display">Brief</h3>
                  <p class="process-copy">
                    Content, constraints and the parts that should stay quiet. The shape of the work comes before the screens.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="process-card" data-process-card>
                <div class="process-visual" data-process-visual>
                  <img
                    class="process-visual-inner process-icon-svg"
                    src="/assets/process-system.svg"
                    alt=""
                    width="284"
                    height="284"
                  />
                </div>
                <span class="process-badge font-display" data-process-badge>02</span>
                <div data-process-copy>
                  <h3 class="process-title font-display">System</h3>
                  <p class="process-copy">
                    Flows, components and a prototype development can actually build. One set of parts, used on purpose.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="process-card" data-process-card>
                <div class="process-visual" data-process-visual>
                  <img
                    class="process-visual-inner process-icon-svg"
                    src="/assets/process-launch.svg"
                    alt=""
                    width="284"
                    height="293"
                  />
                </div>
                <span class="process-badge font-display" data-process-badge>03</span>
                <div data-process-copy>
                  <h3 class="process-title font-display">Launch</h3>
                  <p class="process-copy">
                    Ship it, then lighten whatever still feels heavy. Speed is part of the finish.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </article>

              <div class="process-line" data-process-line aria-hidden="true"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
